---
// Pipeline job status: an empty ring, because the steps describe a plan rather than finished work.
// Parents set the size through --job-icon-size.
---
<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
  .icon { display: inline-block; flex: none; width: var(--job-icon-size, 1.3rem); height: var(--job-icon-size, 1.3rem); border: 2px solid var(--page-dim); border-radius: 50%; }
</style>
